Severity: High Risk
Context: ATokenERC6909.sol#L396-L432.
Description: Mixing of scaled an unscaled parameters in arithmetic (addition / subtraction) operations has been
used in _afterTokenTransfer. The amount input to _afterTokenTransfer comes from super.{transfer,
