a hole in the access control. We would still recommend the following changes:

   1. Explicitly enforce that these functions are only delegatecalled. The follow-
     ing contract demonstrates how this can be achieved.
abstract contract OnlyDelegateCallable {
    address immutable deploymentAddress = address(this);
    modifier onlyDelegateCallable() {
        require(address(this) != deploymentAddress);
        _;
    }
}

