,!   s.portalFeeDebt[_transferId]);
}

Recommendation: It might be useful to convert the adopted asset amount back to the local asset such that
subsequent swaps do not fail due to an insufficient amount of local asset. Alternatively, if the attempt to back
unbacked debt fails, consider transferring the adopted asset out to the liquidity provider so they can handle this
themselves.
