There is no length check in the reply's signature so sigBytes can be any size from 0 to 64MBs.
G1Point.Deserialize() will call bn254utils.DeserializeG1() with whatever data is returned from the DA node.
func (p *G1Point) Deserialize(data []byte) *G1Point {
    return &G1Point{bn254utils.DeserializeG1(data)}
