   ...
} else {
    startingBalance = LibAsset.getOwnBalance(transferredAssetId) - msg.value;
}

However in Executor.sol function swapAndCompleteBridgeTokensViaStargate() isn’t optimal for ERC20 tokens
because ERC20 tokens are already deposited in the contract before calling this function.
