3.1.4 Malicious merchant can siphon subscriber funds indefinitely by deleting and recreating a
      plan with an extended end_ts

Severity: High Risk
Context: (No context files were provided by the reviewer)
Description: This is the converse of ”Attacker can permanently block PDA creation by over-funding the
address beyond the rent-exempt minimum”. Where that finding inflates amount to drain funds instantly,
this attack extends end_ts to siphon funds perpetually beyond the subscriber's agreed timeline.
The transfer_subscription instruction reads the plan's expiry timestamp from the current on-chain
Plan account at transfer time:
// transfer_subscription.rs:48-51
