3.2.4 Asset removal bricks pending requests and enables sweeping escrowed funds

Severity: Medium Risk
Context: kpkShares.sol#L554-L557, kpkShares.sol#L852-L862
Description: Removing an asset while requests are pending , deletes its configuration and permits
recovery to sweep escrowed subscription balances to the portfolio safe .
After a sweep, subscription cancels/approvals fail due to insufficient balance on the shares contract.
In parallel, pending redemptions for the removed asset cannot be approved because sharesToAssets
enforces canRedeem , which is now false/missing bricking user exits. However users can then wait for ttl
